{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "notes": "Routing table for studio/models.py. One specialist per job (roadmap §8.1). Prices are USD per 1M tokens; re-rank monthly from real ledger data, not pricing pages. A provider activates only if its env_key is present and non-empty in .env.",
